{"id":"vod_sn_39161","vodId":"39161","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"来自多彩世界的明天","name_cn":"来自多彩世界的明天","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ddc758e67b380d04a0a02097b47afd63.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在未来的世界之中，彼时，人类已经可以在日常生活中使用少量的魔法月白瞳美（石原夏织 配音）是拥有着魔法使血统的魔族末裔，虽然能够使用魔法，但是在生活里月白一直都对此十分回避。月白自幼患有色觉障碍症，无法看到颜色，生活在黑白世界中的她因此性格也十分的压抑和冷漠。祖母非常担心月白的未来，于是施法将她送回了2018年的长崎。　　在60年前的长崎，月白遇见了还是高中生的祖母琥珀（本渡枫 配音），更让月白感到惊讶的是，自己眼前的世界竟然变得绚丽多彩起来。热衷于画画的葵唯翔（千叶翔也 配音）、温文尔雅的山吹将（前田诚二 配音）、开朗乐观的川合胡桃（东山奈央 配音），在这里，月白很快就交到了朋友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7xSdH3d5QQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cr94Tvj8zR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xHe22wbfX11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ssb9QbG2zD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j0axzxYfWe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bi1bg46Bwm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rkVWYPuCHJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v9i8ieqYMY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YSuJFdzxmb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wxZpydP4yv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R3rfmDCqHy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5GfugAj4x31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/evZQDk3z4d1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:49.868Z"}